### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello

### Projects - list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects

### Projects - create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study Algorithms Final",
  "estimatedPomodoros": 10,
  "actualPomodoros": 0,
  "totalTimeSpent": 0
}

### Projects - get by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1

### Projects - update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study Algorithms Final v2",
  "estimatedPomodoros": 12,
  "actualPomodoros": 0,
  "totalTimeSpent": 0
}

### Projects - complete pomodoro
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/completePomodoro

### Projects - delete by id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1

### Projects - delete all
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/projects

### Sessions - list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sessions

### Sessions - list by project
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sessions?projectId=1

### Sessions - create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project": { "id": 1 },
  "durationMinutes": 25,
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### Sessions - get by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/1

### Sessions - update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project": { "id": 1 },
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "status": "INTERRUPTED"
}

### Sessions - delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/1

### Timers - list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/timers

### Timers - list by project
GET http://localhost:8080/api/timers?projectId=1

### Timers - create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/timers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project": { "id": 1 },
  "workDurationMinutes": 25,
  "breakDurationMinutes": 5,
  "remainingSeconds": 0,
  "running": false
}

### Timers - get by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/timers/1

### Timers - update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/timers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project": { "id": 1 },
  "workDurationMinutes": 30,
  "breakDurationMinutes": 10,
  "remainingSeconds": 900,
  "running": true
}

### Timers - delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/timers/1